rd, right? But beware! Missing even the tiniest detail could turn you into clone chow!\n\n🙏 Please give support to Nacho Sama by playing the original game.\n\nTags: Neighbor, Thatsnotmy, That'snotmy, ThatsNotMyNeighbor, That'sNotMyNeighbor, Doppelganger, Clone, Horror, PapersPlease, Cats","path":"/game/16794833014-thats-not-my-robloxian","slug":"16794833014-thats-not-my-robloxian","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f10a522f73dd9edbdd6cc470672340a959cc20f9efc200a0a38b92f30dcd2a9d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9592c344f635e6125a4b5e94417f1c11/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":33,"visitor":99688946,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-17T09:00:41.247Z","creator":{"name":"Scary Developers","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":76148928963494,"name":"[💕] Shoot the Murderer","desc":"Work together as the sheriffs to shoot the murderer, or become the murderer and kill everyone in sight!\n\n😈 MURDERER - Murder everyone without getting shot!\n🤠 SHERIFFS - Team up to shoot and kill the murderer!\n\nPlease 👍 and ⭐️ the game for game updates!\n\n🔪 Enjoy a new spin in the murder genre!\n🔥Unlock hundreds of unique weapons!\n👥Team up or go against your friends!\n🏆Compete against players worldwide for the leaderboards!\n🎁Unlock rewards for playing the game!\n\nJOIN THE GROUP FOR +25% XP! ✨\nhttps://www.roblox.com/communities/35155218/Shoot-the-Murderer#!/about","path":"/game/76148928963494-shoot-the-murderer","slug":"76148928963494-shoot-the-murderer","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/32ebf68bcb702779a247ccea16774ad9e5deec8f207e72c417ab60773c1030d9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f6043861322a8b3942a4ea0f56e98a0e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":33,"visitor":42576720,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-21T15:23:00.070Z","creator":{"name":"Shoot the Murderer","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6220960770,"name":"Blades World ⚔️","desc":"Welcome to the World of Blades!\n\n⚡Train to become more POWERFUL\n🤺 FIGHT other players\n💪 DOMINATE the server\n⚔️ Unlock and unbox RARE BLADES\n\n(Exciting updates every week!)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGames this is related to:\nSword Simulator, Sword Simulator 2, Weapon Masters, Weapon Simulator, Scythe Simulator, Reborn As Swordman, Strong Sword Simulator, Weapon Legends Simulator","path":"/game/6220960770-blades-world","slug":"6220960770-blades-world","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/fa41a17bcdd95476462fb5e1729576a91969fb544f10c4c68d42261c8c966a08.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f3e2710106a88df7b28c1d1f3710bf71/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":33,"visitor":13728746,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-07T18:53:52.549Z","creator":{"name":"Blades World","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":77483797026305,"name":"⚔️ Sword Fights on the Heights IV: Reforged ","desc":"Welcome to Sword Fights on The Heights IV: Reforged, a faithful remake of Shedletsky's classic game.\n\nReforged aims to bring the Heights back to their former glory — battle on a fixed and expanded map!\n\n⚔️ Fight using classic and new swords: the Earthsplitter, Sky Dagger, Hyacinth, Voidcaller, and Flashbolt!\n\n🥤 Fight with new and revamped power-ups such as the Jet Boots, Bloxy Cola, Slateskin Potion, and Flame Orb.\n\n🔍 Discover hidden badges old and new throughout the map!\n\n🚩 Participate in community events and streaking tournaments.\n_________________________________________________\n\nJoin the community server for tournaments, event news, and announcements.\n\nSword Fights on The Heights IV: Reforged is a remaster of Shedletsky's Sword Fights on The Heights IV.  As such, all credit goes to Shedletsky and the original game.\n\nTags: SFOTHO, SFOTH V, sword fights on the heights iv, sword fighting, SFOTH, linked, dusekkar","path":"/game/77483797026305-sword-fights-on-the-heights-iv-reforged","slug